      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "POSTERIZED (5) led from this barrier to win last month at Cranbourne and looks close to another success after back-to-back Melton placings, last time drawing on the back row but working home in good style to finish 4 metres from the winner in second. Won the only time he raced here. Primary contender. MAJOR ROY (8) produced an encouraging effort when third at this circuit and distance at his first run back from a spell. Fitter and if he get the gaps he is good enough to take out a race like this. BELLA LOUISE (2) draws well and is in the mix following a fourth from the back line at her most recent appearance at Cranbourne. BLAZIN BY (9) won fresh at Kilmore before a fourth from this row last start. Go well.",
